Training core. The joystick task, reward library, domain randomization
and training wrappers descend from w01-tek
(https://github.com/machinekind/w01-tek, Apache-2.0), which in turn ports
them from Google DeepMind's MuJoCo Playground
(https://github.com/google-deepmind/mujoco_playground, Apache-2.0). The
PPO hyper-parameters and network sizes start from Playground's tuned Go1
configuration.

Biped reward terms. Several terms in src/humanoid_lab/rewards/terms.py
(pose_l1, joint_pos_limits, joint_vel, joint_acc, upward, distance_band
for the feet and knee bands, feet_contact_without_cmd, feet_air_time_biped) are
ported from RoboLab, the training module of Roboparty/roboto_origin
(modules/roboparty_train/robolab/), Copyright (c) 2022-2025 The Isaac Lab
Project Developers and (c) 2025-2026 The RoboLab Project Developers,
licensed under BSD-3-Clause. The license text is vendored at
robots/roboto_origin/robolab-LICENSE.

